    "quiet_nature_book": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1696563757209-aac44f1e8d1f?crop=entropy&cs=srgb&fm=jpg&ixid=M3w3NDk1ODB8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxwZWFjZWZ1bCUyMG5hdHVyZSUyMHdhcm0lMjBhY2FkZW1pYyUyMGFlc3RoZXRpYyUyMGJvb2tzJTIwc3R1ZHl8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzkwNTE0MDU4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85"
  },
  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "Never use Inter, Roboto, or Space Grotesk. Font stack must use Plus Jakarta Sans and Newsreader.",
    "Do NOT use em dashes (—) or double hyphens (--) anywhere in text copy. Use colons, commas, or parentheses instead.",
    "Avoid AI hype jargon ('supercharge', 'AI-powered', 'magic'). Keep copy humble, personal, clear, and academic.",
    "Ensure both Light and Dark themes look rich and warm. Light mode background is warm paper (#F9F8F5), Dark mode background is warm obsidian (#161513).",
    "Subject colors must follow the calm subject palette defined in subject_color_palette.",
    "Every interactive element must have a data-testid attribute.",
    "Ensure the client-side Focus Timer has a tranquil, full-screen distraction-free mode.",
    "Notebook canvas must feel like writing on high-quality cream paper."
  ]
}